Subject: Port: online error codes for the WFC server's monitoring
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Recharged builds also tell the WFC server the error codes their players get
outside a match, so the server can show what goes wrong online (the port's
src/platform/online_reports.h). Every numbered error popup of the online
login, matchmaking, friends and menus takes its number from
GetOnlineErrorPopup (gOnlineErrorCode); there the port's
src/platform/online_match_snapshot.cpp now records the number, with the
session state at the time and the Mii's WFC profile. Nothing else changes.

The hook joins tweak patch 0037's interface, include/mscharged_online_reports.h.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_online_reports.h b/include/mscharged_online_reports.h
index a189425..a954b0e 100644
--- a/include/mscharged_online_reports.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_online_reports.h
@@ -14,6 +14,12 @@ extern "C" {
 // a sync error, 4 a lost connection), the goals of home and away, and whether
 // the game had settled this game's result before (mGameResultReported).
 void mscharged_tweak_online_game_result(int result, int homeScore, int awayScore, int reported);
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+// Where the game shows an online error code (GetOnlineErrorPopup, for the
+// popups of the login, matchmaking, friends and online menus): the number the
+// popup shows (gOnlineErrorCode).
+void mscharged_tweak_online_error(int code);
+#endif
 
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 }
